    println!("   • Verification for 1000s of cases still leaves infinite cases");
    println!("   • Rigorous proof requires new theoretical insights");
    println!();
    
    println!("2. DIFFERENT DIFFICULTY LEVELS");
    println!("   • Yang-Mills: Nearly solved computationally (lattice QCD)");
    println!("   • P vs NP: Vast gap between verification and solving");
    println!("   • Hodge: Most abstract, least computational approach");
    println!();
    
    println!("3. SPECIALIZED TECHNIQUES NEEDED");
